8.2 Host-Level Tuning

  NUMA Pinning:    Pin pod to NUMA node closest to GPU
  Hugepages:       2MB for shared arena, 1GB for FAISS index load
  GPU Isolation:   MIG on A100 if sharing with other workloads
  PCIe Topology:   Ensure GPU + NIC on same PCIe root complex
  RMM Pool:        Enable RMM for FAISS GPU (avoid cudaMalloc overhead)
  CPU Manager:     Static policy for guaranteed QoS pods

8.3 Index Loading Strategy

  Init Container:
    1. Download latest index from feature store / S3
    2. Load into shared volume
  
  Main Container:
    1. Read index from PersistentVolume
    2. Load into GPU VRAM: index_cpu_to_gpu()
    3. Warm up with synthetic queries
    4. Start serving

  Index Refresh:
    • Fraud: rebuild hourly (rolling window of 90-day transactions)
    • Siri: rebuild daily (all entities), near-real-time for new contacts
    • Blue-green deployment: build new index → swap pointer → no downtime

